README file for White-throated Sparrow rhythm manuscript

Most of the analyses are performed in the most recent R script that begins with "WTSP song analyses"

Additionally, figures are created and additional analyses are performed with scripts called:
map_plots_May2024_mods.R
multinomial_Year_x_Longitude.R

The sound recordings that are analyzed have been standardized to 16-bit depth. These recordings can be found
in the repository folder called "terminal_strophe_recordings_16bit".